-- Rules that answer TRUE or FALSE with no IMPORT: one that may refuse
-- through a definition in this file, one whose REFUSE is an operand of OR,
-- and one that cannot refuse. Every assignment of a rule's inputs is a case.
-- See boolean-rules.l4 for what an "agreement:" line says, and for `pad`.
--
-- agreement: settled may refuse with ["residence is not modelled"]
-- agreement: settled {"adult": true, "applicant": true} => answers true
-- agreement: settled {"adult": true, "applicant": false} => refuses "residence is not modelled"
-- agreement: settled {"adult": false, "applicant": true} => answers false
-- agreement: settled {"adult": false, "applicant": false} => answers false
--
-- agreement: eligible may refuse with ["residence abroad is not modelled"]
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": true, "resident": true} => answers true
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": true, "resident": false} => refuses "residence abroad is not modelled"
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": false, "resident": true} => answers false
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": false, "resident": false} => answers false
--
-- agreement: planned may refuse with []
-- agreement: planned is planned from its inputs
-- agreement: planned {"adult": true, "resident": true} => answers true
-- agreement: planned {"adult": true, "resident": false} => answers false
-- agreement: planned {"adult": false, "resident": true} => answers false
-- agreement: planned {"adult": false, "resident": false} => answers false

GIVEN person IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is resident` person MEANS
    IF person THEN TRUE
    ELSE REFUSE "residence is not modelled"

@export whether the applicant is settled
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      applicant IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE settled IF adult AND `the person is resident` applicant

@export whether the applicant is eligible
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE eligible IF adult AND (resident OR REFUSE "residence abroad is not modelled")

@export whether the applicant is planned
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE planned IF adult AND resident
